Your melee and ranged attacks leave your foes unable to focus on any complex actions, giving them a stacking 3% chance of failure the next time they try to use a talent (to a maximum of [9%, 21%, 30%, 36%, 39% (TL1-5)]).

If any effect causes the target's turn to fail they fumble and injure themself, taking [126, 163, 191, 214, 234 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] physical damage.

If the turn loss was caused by this effect then Fumble is removed.

The damage dealt increases with your Cunning.
